--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ narrow literal picks char overload: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
Minimal guard for the basic_string conversion-fallback misfire on
wide-char instantiations (name-keyed fallback + leaked speculative
diagnostics); distilled from std::stoll(string literal).
